.Dd May 29, 2026
.Dt LOCAL-CI 8
.Os zdots
.Sh NAME
.Nm local-ci
.Nd manage Colima, LGTM, and local GitHub Actions runs
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Ar command
.Op Fl -json
.Sh COMMANDS
.Bl -tag -width reset-password
.It Cm start , Cm stop , Cm restart , Cm status , Cm health , Cm logs
Manage Colima and the LGTM stack.
.It Cm prune
Prune Docker storage; destructive with
.Fl f .
.It Cm rebuild
Delete and recreate the Colima VM.
.It Cm reset-password
Reset Grafana admin password.
.It Cm run
Run GitHub Actions locally via act.
.El
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Bl -tag -width ZDOTS_CI_MEMORY
.It Ev ZDOTS_CI_CPU
Colima vCPU count.
.It Ev ZDOTS_CI_MEMORY
Colima memory in GB.
.It Ev ZDOTS_CI_DISK
Colima disk in GB.
.El
